# Grafana Cloud Terraform variables — copy to terraform.tfvars and fill in
# cp terraform/grafana/terraform.tfvars.example terraform/grafana/terraform.tfvars
# Decrypt existing: ansible-vault decrypt terraform/grafana/terraform.tfvars

grafana_cloud_url   = "https://<your-org>.grafana.net"        # Web UI URL
grafana_cloud_token = "glsa_..."                              # Service Account token
sm_access_token     = "eyJr..."                               # Synthetic Monitoring token (optional)
sm_enabled          = true                                     # Enable Synthetic Monitoring
domain              = "dreamseed.online"                       # Your domain
sm_url              = "https://synthetic-monitoring-api-us-east-0.grafana.net"  # SM API region URL
